  dishName: Adobo
  dishSprite: {fileID: 0}
  pages:
  - Excellent work. The bowl in front of you is the product of Chinese noodle technique,
  - Hokkien merchant settlement, and nearly a century of Lipa panciteria tradition.
  - "The thick broth, the generous offal, the \u201Cchicharon\u201D on top, and the
    raw egg stirred in at the"
  - 'They are the Lipa canon, documented in peer-reviewed heritage research, and
    they distinguish a competent lomi from a merely passable one. '
  - 'The next time you eat a thinner, lighter bowl somewhere else, you will know
    what the thicker Lipa version is doing differently and why. '
